WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.212
Let’s test a few comparisons.

00:00:02.212 --> 00:00:06.242
Sales is one thousand and target is eight hundred.

00:00:06.242 --> 00:00:11.377
One thousand is greater than eight hundred, so the first result should be True.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:16.757
Sales is not equal to target, so the equality check should be False.

00:00:16.757 --> 00:00:21.523
Sales is different from target, so the final comparison should be True.

00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:25.317
Run the cell and confirm those predictions.

00:00:25.317 --> 00:00:27.947
Then change sales to eight hundred.

00:00:27.947 --> 00:00:34.560
Notice which answers flip. This is the basic building block for every decision we write later.
